      "concept": "A practical starting point",
      "primary_text": "Make a practical start on childproofing with The Peach Bucket 6-in-1 Child Safety Kit. It brings together edge and corner protectors, socket guards, cabinet and fridge locks, and door guards for Indian homes. These measures can help address everyday household hazards, but they do not make a home completely child-safe. Adult supervision remains necessary.",
      "headline": "A 6-in-1 Child Safety Kit",
      "cta": "Shop Now"
    },
    {
      "concept": "Guidance for installation",
      "primary_text": "Not sure where to begin with the kit? The Peach Bucket includes 1-to-1 installation video support to guide you as you set up its edge and corner protectors, socket guards, cabinet and fridge locks, and door guards. Choose the areas that need attention in your home, and remember that childproofing measures do not replace adult supervision.",
      "headline": "Installation Video Support Included",
      "cta": "Shop Now"
    },
    {
      "concept": "Purchase-policy reassurance",
      "primary_text": "If you’re considering a childproofing kit, The Peach Bucket pairs practical household measures with stated purchase policies: a 30-day money-back guarantee and a 720-day eligible-failure replacement guarantee. The kit includes edge and corner protectors, socket guards, cabinet and fridge locks, and door guards. Childproofing can help address hazards, but adult supervision remains necessary.",
      "headline": "Practical Measures, With Support",
      "cta": "Shop Now"
    }
  ],
  "internal_notes": [
    "Visual direction: intended for a product-kit photograph on a plain cream background; no image was supplied for inspection.",
    "The brand voice is inferred provisionally from the supplied website observations. Guarantee eligibility details were not supplied, so the policy wording is kept as provided.",
    "The ₹3,299 listed price and ₹299 prepaid savings are omitted to avoid ambiguity about how the savings apply."
  ]
}
